  "notes": {
    "tone": "Direct continuation of Scene 5: no title card. Start in the familiar regression world, then show the line becoming too complex before regularization reorganizes the idea into feature weights.",
    "pacing": "Comfort, discomfort, recognition, control, pressure, elimination, clarity. Formula and compression must not compete; the formula exits fully before lambda pressure compresses the bars.",
